# Agent instructions for this working copy. Untracked on purpose: it is a
# 27KB internal brief, it duplicates the README for every human reader, and it
# named private inference infrastructure. Contributors read README.md and
# CONTRIBUTING.md; agents read this file locally.
CLAUDE.md

