SECURITY_TASKS.md
CODE_TASKS.md

# Local-only working files. Never published.
.local/

# The private-name list for the publish guard. Never tracked: it holds the
# strings the guard exists to keep out of this repo.
.private-names

# Local publish guards. NOT tracked, on purpose.
#
# This repo is public. A committed hook or test that filters private names
# advertises that such a list exists and points at where it lives — a smaller
# version of the mistake of committing the names themselves. Both only function
# with the operator's local list anyway, so tracking them buys nothing.
#
# Enable in a fresh clone:
#   git config core.hooksPath .githooks
.githooks/
packages/engine/src/core/no-private-names.test.ts
